><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 516pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table><div class="BRDSX_h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 18.5pt; text-align: center;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" name="dei:EntityRegistrantName" id="ixv-146">GREAT ELM GROUP, INC.<br/></ix:nonNumeric></div><div class="BRDSX_h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">(Name of Registrant as Specified in Its Charter)</span></div><div class="BRDSX_h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 18.5pt; text-align: center;">(Name of Person(s) Filing Proxy Statement, if other than the Registrant) </div><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_txttab" style="border-spacing: 0; margin-top: 4pt; width: 540pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td colspan="4" style="height: 6pt; width: 540pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" style="width: 540pt; padding-bottom: 4.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Payment of Filing Fee (Check all boxes that apply): </div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 12pt; padding-top: 4.01pt; padding-bottom: 4.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#9746;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt