an', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The Nominating and Corporate Governance Committee recommended and our Board of Directors nominated the following eight individuals for election as directors: Mr.&#160;Matter, Mr.&#160;Reese, Mr.&#160;Scheyer, Mr.&#160;Drapkin, Mr.&#160;Parmelee, Mr.&#160;Nathan, Mr.&#160;Smith and David Schwartz. Mr. Hugar has decided not to stand for reelection and, thus, has not been nominated for reelection. Mr. Hugar will retire immediately following the Annual Meeting. Mr. Hugar&#8217;s decision is not the result of any disagreement with the Company on any matter relating to the Company&#8217;s operations, policies or procedures. </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: justify;">If each of our director nominees is elected, the following table sets forth the expected composition of our Board of Directors and each of our committees following the Annual Stockholders&#8217; Meeting. </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"> </div><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_fintab" style="border-spacing: 0; width: 468pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 6pt; width: 240pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 6.01pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 6.01pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 13.32pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 6.01pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 6.01pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 37.75pt;"><div style